    "detailed_description": "Take a relaxing walk around a surprise-filled island and build your own secret base! Explore the island, meet cute animals, play fun mini-games, and collect cool toys and furniture. Enjoy carefree and happy moments on the island! Play with your friends and share the fun together!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/9125f66992ae44b78dd0a31c8949bd49.poster.avif?t=1736341642\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/9125f66992ae44b78dd0a31c8949bd49.webm?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/9125f66992ae44b78dd0a31c8949bd49.mp4?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wander around the island: Roam aimlessly across the island, go wherever you want, and explore to your heart's content!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/789040859bdb96f978276c01b475c64b.poster.avif?t=1736341642\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/789040859bdb96f978276c01b475c64b.webm?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/789040859bdb96f978276c01b475c64b.mp4?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plant various vegetables: Grow vegetables, earn coins, and use them to unlock surprises from the gacha machine!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/80b01ce1dd809639d8806730fb3b60b5.poster.avif?t=1736341642\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/80b01ce1dd809639d8806730fb3b60b5.webm?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/80b01ce1dd809639d8806730fb3b60b5.mp4?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect fun toys: Discover and collect many unique toys scattered around the island!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/b52e210b1935970bbfc402b60f3afe8c.poster.avif?t=1736341642\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/b52e210b1935970bbfc402b60f3afe8c.webm?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/b52e210b1935970bbfc402b60f3afe8c.mp4?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet cute animals: Find and bring home adorable animals that you encounter in different places on the island!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/7a10941240596ca15f714f0e500cd5a3.poster.avif?t=1736341642\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/7a10941240596ca15f714f0e500cd5a3.webm?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/7a10941240596ca15f714f0e500cd5a3.mp4?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own secret base: Use the toys and furniture you collect to decorate and create your own secret base!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/2f8694732dae369addab385ccda0d13b.poster.avif?t=1736341642\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/2f8694732dae369addab385ccda0d13b.webm?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/2f8694732dae369addab385ccda0d13b.mp4?t=1736341642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with friends: The game supports multiplayer, so enjoy the fun times with your friends!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/f0b41401a95acbea0ce26fffafee664f.avif?t=1736341642\" width=480 height=268 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy the relaxing island life: Bask in the carefree moments on the island, relax, and enjoy every second!</li></ul>",
